Error case: on 2026-10-25 the clocks in Berlin go back at 03:00 CEST, so 02:30 happens twice (00:30 and 01:30 UTC). The time is refused before the nap list is read, no write is sent and the exit code is 1.
-- args --
health
sleep
naps
delete
2026-10-25
02:30
